+## 2026-11-03
+- **The payer's address warning works on a password-protected preview** ([#64](https://github.com/trysarathy/investigation-desk/pull/64)). On a preview with a password, the payment page opened but its check of the payer's address was refused, so the warning about look-alike (poisoned) addresses silently did not appear. The check now works without the password, like the payment page itself. The README says so.
+
